          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu 'we, teera ekitsyori bahara b'abantu baawe abarikhanuura ebi barikugunja omu mitima yaabo, obahanuurire ebiribabaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Baryareeba enaku, abakazi ababaziira engisha, bakazijweka abantu boona omu bujwariro bw'enyerere, bakakora n'ebitambaara by'okwetwekyerera eby'abantu aba buri rugyero, nibahiiga amagara gaabo! nimwija kuhiiga amagara g'abantu bangye, mukiza ag'abandi, ngu mubone kwetungira amagoba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.28.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 28:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mukanjumisa omu bantu bangye ahabw'eigaro rimwe rya sayiri n'otwate tw'oburo, nimwita abantu abatakufiire, mukakiza abatashemereire kugumaho, nimubakirisa ebishuba ebi murikubeihabeihesa abantu bangye, abakunda kuhurira ebishuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
