          "text": " Mukahahaaza omutima gw'ohikiriire n'ebishuba byanyu, ou nyowe ntahahaarize; mwagumya omubi ngu arekye kuhinduka kuruga omu mitwarize ye emibi, akajuna amagara ge; ",
